---
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import workbench from '../assets/product/workbench.png';
import type { AgentGuide } from '../data/agent-guides';
import Icon from './Icon';

interface Props { guide: AgentGuide }
const { guide } = Astro.props;
const sections = [
  { href: '#before-you-start', label: 'Before you start' },
  { href: '#macos-linux', label: 'macOS and Linux' },
  { href: '#windows', label: 'Windows' },
  { href: '#workflow', label: 'The local workflow' },
  { href: '#limits', label: 'What to expect' },
  { href: '#troubleshooting', label: 'Troubleshooting' },
];
---

<article class="agent-guide" aria-labelledby="guide-title">
  <div class="guide-shell">
    <nav class="guide-breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <span aria-current="page">{guide.title}</span>
    </nav>

    <header class="guide-opening">
      <div class="guide-opening-copy">
        <p class="guide-eyebrow">Lomi guide <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> {guide.providerName}</p>
        <h1 id="guide-title">{guide.title}</h1>
        <p class="guide-summary">{guide.summary}</p>
        <div class="guide-actions">
          <a class="button button-primary guide-download" href="/download/">Download Lomi<Icon name="diagonal" width={15} height={15} /></a>
          <a class="guide-official" href={guide.officialDocs.href}>{guide.officialDocs.label}<Icon name="diagonal" width={14} height={14} /></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figure class="guide-visual">
        <Picture
          src={workbench}
          alt={guide.heroAlt}
          class="guide-workbench"
          formats={['avif', 'webp']}
          widths={[640, 960, 1280, 1600]}
          sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 560px, (min-width: 768px) 48vw, calc(100vw - 40px)"
          loading="eager"
          decoding="async"
        />
        <figcaption>Captured in Lomi: a project explorer, code editor and terminal.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </header>

    <div class="guide-layout">
      <nav class="guide-toc" aria-label="On this page">
        <h2>On this page</h2>
        <ol>{sections.map((section) => <li><a href={section.href}>{section.label}</a></li>)}</ol>
      </nav>

      <div class="guide-copy">
        <section id="before-you-start" aria-labelledby="before-title">
          <h2 id="before-title">Before you start</h2>
          <p>Set up {guide.providerName} separately, then open the project you want it to work on in Lomi.</p>
          <ul class="guide-checklist">
            {guide.prerequisites.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
          </ul>
          <p class="guide-resource">Use <a href={guide.officialDocs.href}>{guide.officialDocs.label}<Icon name="diagonal" width={13} height={13} /></a> for current installation, supported-shell and authentication details.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="macos-linux" aria-labelledby="local-title">
          <h2 id="local-title">Launch {guide.providerName} in Lomi on macOS and Linux</h2>
          <p>{guide.localLaunchNote}</p>
          <ol class="guide-steps">
            {guide.localLaunchSteps.map((step) => <li>
              <div><h3>{step.title}</h3><p>{step.description}</p></div>
            </li>)}
          </ol>
        </section>

        <section id="windows" aria-labelledby="windows-title">
          <h2 id="windows-title">On Windows, start it from a terminal</h2>
          <p>On Windows, Lomi cannot detect or launch agent CLIs from Agents. Install {guide.providerName} using the vendor’s Windows or WSL instructions, then start it from a project terminal.</p>
          <ol class="guide-steps guide-steps-compact">
            {guide.windowsSteps.map((step) => <li>
              <div><h3>{step.title}</h3><p>{step.description}</p></div>
            </li>)}
          </ol>
          <div class="guide-command"><span>Start {guide.providerName} from the project terminal</span><code>{guide.command}</code></div>
          <p class="guide-platform-note">{guide.windowsNote}</p>
          <p class="guide-resource">Follow <a href={guide.officialDocs.href}>{guide.officialDocs.label}<Icon name="diagonal" width={13} height={13} /></a> for the current platform requirements and setup path.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="workflow" aria-labelledby="workflow-title">
          <h2 id="workflow-title">Keep the coding loop in one workspace</h2>
          <p>With the CLI running, use other Lomi panes to run and preview your project, then review the diff in Git:</p>
          <ol class="guide-steps guide-steps-compact">
            {guide.workflowSteps.map((step) => <li>
              <div><h3>{step.title}</h3><p>{step.description}</p></div>
            </li>)}
          </ol>
        </section>

        <section id="limits" aria-labelledby="limits-title">
          <h2 id="limits-title">What this workflow includes</h2>
          <p>Lomi gives the CLI a local workspace with your project files, terminals and browser.</p>
          <ul class="guide-checklist guide-limits">
            {guide.limits.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section id="troubleshooting" aria-labelledby="troubleshooting-title">
          <h2 id="troubleshooting-title">If {guide.providerName} does not start</h2>
          <ol class="guide-steps guide-steps-compact">
            <li><div>
              <h3>Check the shell used by Agents</h3>
              <p>On macOS and Linux, open a regular terminal with the same local shell selected in Agents. Run <code>command -v {guide.command}</code> to check that the shell can find the CLI. If it cannot, follow the vendor’s installation and shell-path instructions, then use Refresh installed CLI in Lomi.</p>
            </div></li>
            <li><div>
              <h3>Confirm the project directory</h3>
              <p>Check the terminal’s working directory before asking the agent to edit files. Use <code>pwd</code> on macOS and Linux or <code>Get-Location</code> in PowerShell. If it is the wrong project, open the intended folder in Lomi and start a terminal there.</p>
            </div></li>
            <li><div>
              <h3>Start your development server separately</h3>
              <p>An agent terminal does not automatically start your app. Run the project’s normal development command in another terminal, wait for its local URL, then open that address in Lomi’s browser. Use the actual port printed by the server.</p>
            </div></li>
          </ol>
          <p>For a two-agent workflow, see <a href="/claude-code-and-codex/">using Claude Code and Codex together</a>, including when to keep edits in separate Git working trees.</p>
        </section>

        <nav class="guide-resources" aria-label="More about Lomi and coding agents">
          <h2>Continue</h2>
          <a href={guide.related.href}>{guide.related.label}<Icon name="arrow" width={15} height={15} /></a>
          <a href="/compare/">Compare coding workspaces<Icon name="arrow" width={15} height={15} /></a>
          <a href="https://docs.lomi.dev">Read the Lomi documentation<Icon name="diagonal" width={14} height={14} /></a>
          <a href="https://github.com/lomi-dev/lomi">Browse Lomi on GitHub<Icon name="diagonal" width={14} height={14} /></a>
          <a href="/download/">Download Lomi<Icon name="arrow" width={15} height={15} /></a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>

<style>
  .agent-guide { --scroll-surface-color: var(--color-paper); padding: 0 0 96px; background: var(--color-paper); color: var(--color-ink); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .guide-shell { width: min(1200px, calc(100% - 80px)); margin-inline: auto; }
  .guide-breadcrumbs { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding-top: 112px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .guide-breadcrumbs a:hover { color: var(--color-ink); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
  .guide-breadcrumbs span:last-child { color: var(--color-ink); }
  .guide-opening { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .95fr) minmax(0, 1.05fr); align-items: center; gap: clamp(44px, 6vw, 88px); padding-top: 36px; }
  .guide-opening-copy { min-width: 0; }
  .guide-eyebrow { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; color: #56624e; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .guide-eyebrow span { color: #9da793; }
  .guide-opening h1 { max-width: 12ch; margin: 17px 0 0; font-size: clamp(48px, 5.3vw, 72px); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.06em; line-height: 1.03; text-wrap: balance; }
  .guide-summary { max-width: 47ch; margin-top: 22px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75; text-wrap: pretty; }
  .guide-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 12px 20px; margin-top: 28px; }
  .guide-official { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; min-height: 48px; }
  .guide-official { color: #35452b; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.55; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: #9ba891; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
  .guide-visual { min-width: 0; margin: 0; }
  .guide-visual :global(picture) { display: block; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-ink) 14%, transparent); border-radius: 12px; background: #131714; box-shadow: 0 20px 50px -28px rgb(20 28 14 / 45%); }
  .guide-visual :global(img) { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .guide-visual figcaption { margin-top: 12px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.6; }

  .guide-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(180px, 220px) minmax(0, 740px); justify-content: space-between; gap: clamp(48px, 7vw, 100px); margin-top: 84px; }
  .guide-toc { position: sticky; top: calc(var(--site-header-height) + 30px); align-self: start; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .guide-toc h2, .guide-resources h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 550; letter-spacing: -.01em; line-height: 1.6; }
  .guide-toc ol { display: grid; gap: 3px; margin: 16px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .guide-toc a { display: block; padding: 8px 0; color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.55; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
  .guide-toc a:hover { color: var(--color-ink); text-decoration: underline; }
  .guide-copy { min-width: 0; }
  .guide-copy section { scroll-margin-top: calc(var(--site-header-height) + 24px); }
  .guide-copy section + section { margin-top: 68px; padding-top: 28px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .guide-copy section > h2 { max-width: 22ch; margin: 0; font-size: clamp(27px, 3vw, 35px); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.045em; line-height: 1.16; text-wrap: balance; }
  .guide-copy section > p { max-width: 68ch; margin-top: 14px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; text-wrap: pretty; }
  .guide-copy h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 520; letter-spacing: -.025em; line-height: 1.4; }
  .guide-copy .guide-steps p { max-width: 64ch; margin-top: 5px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.75; text-wrap: pretty; }
  .guide-checklist { display: grid; gap: 12px; margin: 22px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .guide-checklist li { position: relative; padding-left: 18px; color: #364032; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.75; text-wrap: pretty; }
  .guide-checklist li::before { position: absolute; top: .68em; left: 0; width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: #657654; content: ''; }
  .guide-copy .guide-resource { font-size: 12px; }
  .guide-copy p a { color: #304719; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .guide-copy p code { padding: 2px 4px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px; font: .92em/1.5 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .guide-resource a { display: inline; color: #304719; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: #a2b091; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .guide-resource a svg { display: inline-block; vertical-align: -2px; margin-left: 3px; }
  .guide-steps { counter-reset: guide-step; display: grid; margin: 26px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .guide-steps li { counter-increment: guide-step; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 30px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 14px; padding: 20px 0; border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--line) 75%, transparent); }
  .guide-steps li::before { content: counter(guide-step, decimal-leading-zero); padding-top: 2px; color: #5d6b50; font: 11px/1.5 var(--font-mono); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .guide-steps li:first-child { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .guide-steps-compact { margin-top: 20px; }
  .guide-steps-compact li { padding-block: 17px; }
  .guide-command { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; margin-top: 3px; padding: 14px 16px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-ink) 3%, var(--color-paper)); }
  .guide-command span { color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .guide-command code { padding: 5px 8px; border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--line) 75%, transparent); border-radius: 4px; background: var(--color-paper); color: #293521; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 12px; }
  .guide-platform-note { padding: 16px 18px; border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--line) 80%, transparent); border-radius: 8px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-lime) 10%, var(--color-paper)); color: #3e4938 !important; }
  .guide-limits { gap: 14px; margin-top: 19px; }
  .guide-resources { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 0 24px; margin-top: 68px; padding-top: 18px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .guide-resources h2 { grid-column: 1 / -1; margin-bottom: 9px; }
  .guide-resources a { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; min-height: 48px; border-bottom: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--line) 75%, transparent); color: #35452b; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.55; }
  .guide-resources a:hover { color: var(--color-ink); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }

  @media (max-width: 999px) {
    .guide-shell { width: min(760px, calc(100% - 56px)); }
    .guide-opening { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 34px; }
    .guide-opening-copy { max-width: 650px; }
    .guide-opening h1 { max-width: 14ch; }
    .guide-visual { max-width: 700px; }
    .guide-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin-top: 62px; }
    .guide-toc { position: static; padding-top: 13px; }
    .guide-toc ol { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 18px; margin-top: 8px; }
    .guide-toc a { min-height: 40px; }
    .guide-copy { max-width: 740px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .agent-guide { padding-bottom: 62px; }
    .guide-shell { width: calc(100% - 40px); }
    .guide-breadcrumbs { padding-top: 100px; font-size: 11px; }
    .guide-opening { gap: 27px; padding-top: 25px; }
    .guide-opening h1 { max-width: 13ch; margin-top: 13px; font-size: clamp(43px, 10vw, 59px); letter-spacing: -.055em; }
    .guide-summary { margin-top: 16px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; }
    .guide-actions { gap: 5px 14px; margin-top: 20px; }
    .guide-download { min-height: 46px; padding-inline: 15px; }
    .guide-official { min-height: 44px; font-size: 11px; }
    .guide-visual figcaption { margin-top: 8px; font-size: 10px; }
    .guide-layout { gap: 17px; margin-top: 45px; }
    .guide-toc ol { gap: 0 13px; }
    .guide-toc a { padding-block: 6px; font-size: 11px; }
    .guide-copy section + section { margin-top: 45px; padding-top: 22px; }
    .guide-copy section > h2 { font-size: 28px; }
    .guide-copy section > p { font-size: 13px; }
    .guide-checklist { gap: 10px; margin-top: 17px; }
    .guide-checklist li, .guide-copy .guide-steps p { font-size: 12px; }
    .guide-steps { margin-top: 18px; }
    .guide-steps li { grid-template-columns: 23px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 10px; padding-block: 16px; }
    .guide-copy h3 { font-size: 15px; }
    .guide-platform-note { padding: 14px; }
    .guide-command { padding: 12px; }
    .guide-resources { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); margin-top: 46px; }
    .guide-resources h2 { grid-column: 1; }
  }
</style>
